<dfn at-rule>@example</dfn>
<span id="skip"></span>

<pre class=prod>
<dfn export>&lt;all-symbols></dfn> =
	a ? | b ! || c && d &amp;&amp; e , f * + #
	| g{2} | h{1,3} | i{2,} | j#{2} | k#{1,3} | l#{2,}
	| <<integer [0, 10]>> | [GRAMMAR-PART]
	| '+' '?' '|' '*' '#' '!' ',' '&&'
	| <a href="#skip">a | b + c?</a>
	| <a href="#skip">[GRAMMAR-PART]</a>
</pre>

<xmp class=prod>
<xmp-prod> = foo | bar? && baz{1,2} | qux#{3} | '+'
</xmp>

```prod
<fenced-prod> = foo || bar* + baz! , qux{2,}
```

<pre class=propdef>
Name: example-prop
Value: foo | bar? && baz &amp;&amp; qux{1,2} | <<integer [0, 5]>>#
Initial: foo
Applies to: all elements
Inherited: no
Percentages: n/a
Computed value: specified keyword
Animation type: discrete
</pre>

<pre class="propdef partial">
Name: example-prop
New values: extra+ || more#{2,}
</pre>

<pre class=descdef>
Name: example-desc
For: @example
Value: alpha || beta* | gamma{3}
Initial: alpha
</pre>

<div class=prod>div: foo | bar?</div>

